{"id":"7061bdd7-785f-4e58-a218-26bc7193fbe3","object":"chat.completion","created":1785019932,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    threshold = case['threshold']\\n    calls = case['calls']\\n    accepted_call_ids = []\\n    diagnostics = []\\n    for call in calls:\\n        call_id = call['call_id']\\n        loss_without = call['loss_without_call']\\n        loss_with = call['loss_with_call']\\n        tokens = call['prediction_tokens']\\n        if tokens < 1:\\n            raise ValueError('prediction_tokens must be at least 1')\\n        gain = loss_without - loss_with\\n        normalized_gain = gain / tokens\\n        parseable = call['parseable']\\n        accepted = parseable and normalized_gain >= threshold\\n        diagnostics.append({\\n            'accepted': accepted,\\n            'call_id': call_id,\\n            'normalized_gain': normalized_gain\\n        })\\n        if accepted:\\n            accepted_call_ids.append(call_id)\\n    return {\\n        'accepted_call_ids': accepted_call_ids,\\n        'diagnostics': diagnostics\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for task AGENT-TF-01. The payload contains threshold and calls array. Each call has call_id, loss_without_call, loss_with_call, prediction_tokens, parseable.\n\nWe need to compute for each call:\n- gain = loss_without_call - loss_with_call\n- normalized_gain = gain / prediction_tokens (at least one prediction token, so no division by zero)\n- accepted if parseable is True and normalized_gain >= threshold\n- diagnostics list in same order: each object with accepted, call_id, normalized_gain (number, presumably float)\n- accepted_call_ids: list of call_ids where accepted is True, in same order as they appear in calls.\n\nReturn structure: {\"accepted_call_ids\": [...], \"diagnostics\": [...]}\n\nThe output contract specifies \"normalized_gain\" as number, an